\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Osii w'anan mu wu maa wo,
\par huu amane ne ahohora, 
\par pe s[ ]de regye wo nkwa, 
\par n'[d[n na woay[ ama no? 
